---
import "../style.css";
import { proDesign } from "../pro-design.js";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#050505" />
  <meta name="description" content="See how avocadoMini, avokadoPro, and RockstarOS can turn movement and space into tools for care research, product development, everyday life, and games." />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="avokado — Mini meets Pro" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Make the room part of the experience." />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://avocadomini.si/" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://avocadomini.si/" />
  <title>avokado — Mini meets Pro</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" type="image/png" />
  <script is:inline src="/site-enhancements.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body class="apple-home">
  <a class="skip" href="#main-content">Skip to products</a>
  <header class="apple-home-nav">
    <a class="apple-home-brand" href="/" aria-label="avokado home"><img src="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" alt="" />avokado</a>
    <div class="header-actions">
      <details class="site-menu">
        <summary>Menu</summary>
        <div class="site-menu-panel">
          <p>EXPLORE AVOKADO</p>
          <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
            <a href="https://avocadomini.si/"><span>01</span><strong>avocadoMini</strong><em>Let the space respond to movement</em></a>
            <a href="https://avocadopro.si/"><span>02</span><strong>avokadoPro</strong><em>A compact NVIDIA PC design for si and games</em></a>
            <a href="https://avoado.si/os"><span>03</span><strong>RockstarOS</strong><em>The system foundation</em></a>
            <a href="/rocket-star/"><span>04</span><strong>rocketstar</strong><em>Launch system design</em></a>
          </nav>
        </div>
      </details>
      <a class="header-cta" href="https://avoado.si/os">Open RockstarOS <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main id="main-content">
    <section id="together" class="home-promo home-promo-system" aria-labelledby="system-title">
      <div class="home-promo-copy">
        <p>AVOKADO / SPATIAL EXPERIENCES</p>
        <h1 id="system-title">Make the room part<br />of the experience.</h1>
        <span>Start with the product that gives you what you want. Add more only when the experience grows.</span>
        <div><a href="#possibilities">See what it can do <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a href="#choose-setup">Find your setup <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/r5/avocado-mini-r5-black-studio.png" alt="avocadoMini R5 silver-cylinder concept rendering; manufacturing acceptance is pending" fetchpriority="high" />
      <p class="home-promo-note">R5 targets standalone operation with external power and a maximum height of 200 mm. No separate Edge Hub or Pro is required. Price and manufacturing acceptance remain open.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="possibilities" class="possibility-atlas" aria-labelledby="possibilities-title">
      <div class="possibility-atlas-head">
        <p>MORE THAN A SCREEN</p>
        <h2 id="possibilities-title">Step into<br />what’s next.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="possibility-grid">
        <article class="possibility-card possibility-care">
          <img src="/images/usecase-care-motion-v4.jpg" alt="A participant practising balance while a researcher observes, with Mini beside the activity area" loading="lazy" width="1586" height="992" />
          <div><span>MOTION RESEARCH</span><h3>See movement differently.</h3><a href="https://avocadomini.si/#mini-use-cases">Explore Mini <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        </article>
        <article class="possibility-card possibility-research">
          <img src="/images/usecase-research-development-v4.jpg" alt="A creator testing a physical prototype alongside its software view" loading="lazy" width="1586" height="992" />
          <div><span>CREATE</span><h3>Bring your ideas to life.</h3><a href="https://avocadopro.si/#pro-use-cases">Explore Pro <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        </article>
        <article class="possibility-card possibility-life">
          <img src="/images/usecase-everyday-space-v4.jpg" alt="A person arriving home and gesturing toward a warmly lit room, with Mini on the console" loading="lazy" width="1586" height="992" />
          <div><span>EVERYDAY</span><h3>A room that responds.</h3><a href="https://avocadomini.si/#mini-use-cases">Explore Mini <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        </article>
        <article class="possibility-card possibility-game">
          <img src="/images/usecase-spatial-game-v4.jpg" alt="Illustrated concept of two friends playing a movement-based game; the devices and pairing are not accepted R5 hardware" loading="lazy" width="1586" height="992" />
          <div><span>PLAY</span><h3>Play with your whole body.</h3><a href="https://avocadopro.si/#pro-pairing">Explore Mini + Pro <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="possibility-concept-note">Illustrated spatial-use concepts, not R5 product photographs. Apps and paired hardware remain unvalidated. Not a medical or diagnostic device.</p>
      <div class="possibility-atlas-next"><p>Find your starting point.</p><a href="#choose-setup">Choose your setup <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
    </section>

    <section id="choose-setup" class="setup-chooser" aria-labelledby="setup-title">
      <div class="setup-chooser-head"><p>CHOOSE BY WHAT YOU WANT</p><h2 id="setup-title">Start with the benefit.<br />Build from there.</h2></div>
      <div class="setup-choices">
        <a href="https://avocadomini.si/"><span>01 / FEEL THE SPACE</span><strong>Turn movement into input.</strong><em>Choose avocadoMini →</em></a>
        <a href="https://avocadopro.si/"><span>02 / si & PC GAMES</span><strong>Plan for si and PC games.</strong><em>Choose avokadoPro →</em></a>
        <a href="https://avocadopro.si/#pro-pairing"><span>03 / EXPAND THE ROOM</span><strong>Let the whole room join in.</strong><em>Combine Mini + Pro →</em></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-promo home-promo-mini" aria-labelledby="mini-title">
      <div class="home-promo-copy">
        <p>AVOCADOMINI / R5 / UP TO 200 MM</p>
        <h2 id="mini-title">Your movement.<br />Now part of the experience.</h2>
        <span>A standalone spatial-device design with external power. No separate Edge Hub required. Price undecided; manufacturing acceptance pending.</span>
        <div><a href="https://avocadomini.si/">See what Mini gives you <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a><a href="/preorder/">Price & status <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/r5/avocado-mini-r5-concept.png" alt="avocadoMini R5 concept with a maximum design height of 200 mm; not an accepted manufactured device" loading="lazy" />
    </section>

    <section class="home-promo home-promo-pro" aria-labelledby="pro-title">
      <div class="home-promo-copy">
        <p>AVOKADOPRO / COMPACT NVIDIA PC</p>
        <h2 id="pro-title">si and PC games.<br />A place on your desk.</h2>
        <span>{proDesign.targetLabel}. Mini is optional. Not yet assembled; sales closed.</span>
        <div><a href="https://avocadopro.si/">See what Pro unlocks <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a><a href="/preorder/">Price & status <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div>
      </div>
      <img src={proDesign.image} alt="Pro PC design study with candidate hardware; not an assembled product" loading="lazy" />
    </section>

    <section class="home-tile-grid" aria-label="More from avokado">
      <article class="home-tile home-tile-os"><div><p>ROCKSTAROS</p><h2>One foundation.<br />Less friction.</h2><span>The system layer for approved products and experiences.</span><a href="https://avoado.si/os">Check RockstarOS status <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div><div class="home-os-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div></article>
      <article class="home-tile home-tile-four"><div><p>OPTIONAL R5 EXPANSION</p><h2>More viewpoints.<br />More room to move.</h2><span>Add matching Minis when you need more viewpoints. Multi-device performance needs testing; price undecided.</span><a href="https://avocadomini.si/#product">Build your Mini setup <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div></article>
      <article class="home-tile home-tile-pair"><div><p>MINI + PRO</p><h2>The room joins<br />the game.</h2><span>Mini and Pro remain independent. Optional pairing needs hardware and compatibility validation.</span><a href="https://avocadopro.si/#pro-pairing">Explore optional pairing <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div></article>
      <article class="home-tile home-tile-rocket"><div><p>ROCKETSTAR</p><h2>Beyond the room.</h2><span>Explore the launch system design.</span><a href="/rocket-star/">Explore rocketstar <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div><img src="/images/rocket-star-orbit.png" alt="rocketstar launch system concept" loading="lazy" /></article>
    </section>
    <section class="support-cta" aria-labelledby="support-title"><p>FOLLOW THE BUILD</p><h2 id="support-title">Want to see this become real?</h2><span>Follow development, share the project, and help the next experience find its audience.</span><div><a href="https://www.instagram.com/kirin.41/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Follow development ↗</a><a href="/preorder/">See price & status →</a></div></section>
    <section class="company-proof" aria-labelledby="company-proof-title"> <div><p>OPERATED BY</p><h2 id="company-proof-title">AVOKADO LLC</h2></div> <div class="company-proof-details"><p>avokado and avocadoMini are developed and operated by AVOKADO LLC, a New York domestic limited liability company.</p><dl><div><dt>New York DOS ID</dt><dd>8031610</dd></div><div><dt>Formed</dt><dd>September 27, 2026</dd></div><div><dt>Contact</dt><dd><a href="mailto:kirin.999@icloud.com">kirin.999@icloud.com</a></dd></div></dl><a href="/legal/#company-information">View company information <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div> </section>
  </main>
  <style>.home-promo-pro > img { height: 58%; object-fit: contain; object-position: center bottom; } @media(max-width:760px) { .home-promo-pro { min-height: 760px; } .home-promo-pro > img { height: 48%; } }</style>

  <footer class="apple-home-footer"><p>R5 pricing is undecided. Mini manufacturing and performance are not yet accepted. Pro has a ¥800,000 design target with tax and shipping undecided, not a sales offer. Designs and performance remain unvalidated.</p><div><span>© 2026 AVOKADO LLC</span><a href="https://avocadomini.si/">avocadoMini</a><a href="https://avocadopro.si/">avokadoPro</a><a href="/legal/">Sales disclosure</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="https://github.com/k999ln/rock">Development repository ↗</a></div></footer>
</body>
</html>
